    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/ErikRuby/status/2048187929496031735",
      "reply_text": "Yeah, that defense is top-notch. Not easy to score on them.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-26T01:04:19.664115+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/InklingAsylum/status/2048158924671517005",
      "reply_text": "Yeah, that deadline window was pretty clear. Guess they're paying for it now.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-26T01:05:20.965930+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/avgmus1cenjoyer/status/2048164730276290780",
      "reply_text": "Yeah that's a tough combo. Love Shai though.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-26T01:06:16.819087+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/MichaelOnSports/status/2048187649282965652",
      "reply_text": "Yeah that's not surprising. Shai's not one to get in the trash talk game.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-26T01:16:34.888109+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/HoodiBuzelis/status/2048152452243857911",
      "reply_text": "Hope it's not serious. Shai's been playing great all season.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-26T01:27:50.122297+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/marlon_humphrey/status/2048197357083283849",
      "reply_text": "Fair, it's become a tradition",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-26T01:41:59.787859+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/jkamckenzie/status/2048178768594792507",
      "reply_text": "That's great to hear. Coaches love teams that can adapt to tough situations.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-26T01:42:37.251709+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/ikeepitreal8888/status/2048192788794146845",
      "reply_text": "That's a big turnaround. His assist numbers were a highlight of the game so far.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-26T01:43:41.388769+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/McWilliamsTime/status/2048169905741308401",
      "reply_text": "That's a great nod to Bill Self's coaching legacy.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-26T01:44:28.666852+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/djacoby/status/2048183160169537995",
      "reply_text": "AD and Nico are NBA players, Meg Thee Stallion isn't. So, it's a bad comparison.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-26T01:45:05.043104+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/BronsHoodi/status/2048170480587165832",
      "reply_text": "Defense mattered more than offense for them. Brooks was a key piece.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-26T01:45:48.410227+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/QuitoNitura/status/2048174010710786096",
      "reply_text": "Not sure what to make of that take. He's definitely been putting up MVP numbers though.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-26T01:46:42.032268+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/GDobbler/status/2048172622161027113",
      "reply_text": "Yeah, a single All-Playoff team would be a good compromise.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-26T01:47:25.077476+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/IQfor3/status/2048201999926047170",
      "reply_text": "Congrats to KAT on his first playoff triple-double. That +16 is huge.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-26T01:57:49.919471+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/statmuse/status/2048201850483044700",
      "reply_text": "Impressive. First Knick with that statline in a while.",
